Source: concat-unstable
Section: video
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ackerman-00 <quietcraft@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cargo, rustc, gcc, g++, cmake, make, pkgconf, libclang-dev, libfontconfig1-dev, libfreetype6-dev, libxkbcommon-dev, libgl1-mesa-dev, libgtk-3-dev, libasound2-dev, desktop-file-utils
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/jub0t/concat

Package: concat-unstable
Architecture: amd64
# Native cargo source build of upstream main: hand-mapped Depends (same
# engine + GUI stack as the stable repack, whose payload ldd was verified;
# docker-sweep ldd on the built .deb re-verifies). shlibdeps is skipped
# because the bundled FFmpeg/ONNX libs under the package lib dir have no
# system providers and would only add noise.
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, hicolor-icon-theme, libasound2t64, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libgcc-s1, libgl1, libgtk-3-0t64, libstdc++6, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libxkbcommon0
Description: Free and open source video editor (main-branch snapshot)
 Concat main-branch snapshot: free and open source video editor with
 FFmpeg underneath. Tracks upstream main past the latest release.
